# Conditional Concept Range Example
# Conditional specification using Concept range generator for child concept values.
# From Story121/Story122: CPL Concepts Parser/Analyzer — Conditional

concepts
	Quarter=[Values[Q1, Q2, Q3, Q4]]
	Year=[Int[2020, 2025, 1]]
	# First half of 2024
	Year[2024] => FirstHalf=[Quarter[Q1..Q2]]
